/// <code>Canvas.restore</code> is called. Each call to <code>Canvas.saveLayer</code> introduces a new
/// layer onto which shapes and images are painted; when <code>Canvas.restore</code> is
/// called, that layer is then composited onto the parent layer, with the source
/// being the most-recently-drawn shapes and images, and the destination being
